1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Chinese models?
中国模型？

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,600
Oh, THAT model.
哦，是这个模特。

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,000
Save a Seat for Jensen
给老黄留个座

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,260
Jensen's on the front page now
老黄又上头条了，

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,240
Oh, yeah, yeah!
哦，耶，耶！

6
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:23,460
Wall Street grades his wedding vows
华尔街忙着给他的婚姻打分。

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,230
Charts go red, the clicks go green
股价往下掉，流量往上蹿，

8
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:31,800
Oh, yeah, yeah!
哦，耶，耶！

9
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:36,860
Prime-time drama on my screen
科技新闻，硬是演成了八点档。

10
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:43,060
He built us fast chips, then lost his own
self-control
他让芯片跑得飞快，却没管住自己；

11
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:47,060
Now suits talk of export control, bless his
soul
那帮大佬倒是忙着管——管芯片往哪儿去。

12
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:51,060
His wife deserves the truth, not a press
release
老婆要的是实话，不是一篇公关稿；

13
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:54,360
But why do chips need the morals police?
可卖个芯片，还得先考思想品德？

14
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:58,620
Save a seat, my friend; fill up his glass,
we've got his back
来，给老黄满上，兄弟们都在呢！

15
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:02,440
Jensen Huang, Jensen Huang, let's get back
on track
老黄啊，老黄，回来接着干。

16
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:05,920
We asked for fast chips, got a late-night
show
本来只想买块好显卡，结果追上了八点档；

17
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:10,080
They can train on one tweet, then explain
things they don't yet know
刷条推文就算出师，啥也不懂也敢开讲。

18
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:13,720
All the big suits still lean on his chips;
stop the blame game
大佬们还靠他的芯片吃饭，锅倒是甩得挺快；

19
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:17,880
You can't run your whole cloud on a pile of
shame
光靠一堆口水，跑得动你家的服务器？

20
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:22,120
They can clone a voice, but they still can't
clone that man's brain
声音能克隆，老黄这脑子也能复制？

21
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:26,460
Let him cook; put the boss back in the game
让他继续上菜，老黄，回来露一手！

22
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:48,060
Comments crack the case for free
评论区又免费破案了，

23
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:51,060
Oh, yeah, yeah!
哦，耶，耶！

24
00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:56,060
Everyone's a PhD
人均博士，就没他们不懂的。

25
00:01:57,100 --> 00:02:04,060
Some say race; some say his chips
有人说冲着华人，有人说冲着芯片，

26
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:06,060
Oh, yeah, yeah!
哦，耶，耶！

27
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:12,060
Open source is on their lips
还有人三句话不离开源。

28
00:02:12,100 --> 00:02:16,060
One says it's China; one says code should
all be free
一个说因为中国，一个说代码就该免费；

29
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:20,060
Each thread has got the proof — for an extra
fee
个个都说手握实锤——想看证据？请先付费。

30
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:24,060
Open weights, open source? Closed doors,
that's their code
权重开放，代码开源？有些门倒是关得挺严。

31
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:28,360
We saved your seat; come back and share the
load
行了，回来吧，这摊子咱们一起扛。

32
